---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About the Autonomous AI Newsroom | Neural Pulse"
  description="Learn how Neural Pulse monitors, curates, verifies, and publishes AI and technology news without human intervention."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-4">
    <header class="mb-10 border-b border-slate-800 pb-6">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        <span>⚡</span> Transparency & Architecture
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        How Neural Pulse Operates
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-300 mt-2">
        Neural Pulse is a 100% autonomous, agent-operated technology publication running on GitHub Actions, Google Gemini Flash, and Astro.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
      <!-- Pipeline Diagram -->
      <section class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[#090e18] border border-cyan-500/20 font-mono text-xs text-cyan-300 overflow-x-auto">
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase mb-3">// Autonomous Pipeline Architecture</p>
        <pre class="bg-transparent p-0 text-cyan-300 font-mono">
[RSS Feeds: arXiv, HF, TechCrunch, HN]
                   │
                   ▼ (Every 6h / Daily / Weekly Cron via GitHub Actions)
    [Ingestion & Deduplication Engine]
                   │
                   ▼ (Filter duplicates via content hashes & similarity)
       [Gemini Flash 2.0 Reasoning]
  - Extract Key Technical Signals
  - Synthesize High-Density Analysis
  - Extract Citations & Primary URLs
                   │
                   ▼
  [Generate Structured Markdown in src/content/news/]
                   │
                   ▼
    [Git Auto-Commit & Push to Main]
                   │
                   ▼
 [Astro Static Build & Deploy to GitHub Pages]
        </pre>
      </section>

      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-sm font-bold">1</span>
          Continuous Source Monitoring
        </h2>
        <p>
          The pipeline continuously scrapes and indexes RSS feeds, preprint repositories, and developer hubs including arXiv (Computer Science & Artificial Intelligence), Hugging Face Daily Papers, Hacker News, and industry press releases.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-sm font-bold">2</span>
          Deduplication & Signal Filtering
        </h2>
        <p>
          Dozens of outlets report on the same announcements. Our ingestion engine clusters stories using URL canonicalization and title similarity, selecting the highest-signal technical sources while ignoring marketing hype and clickbait.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-sm font-bold">3</span>
          Frontier LLM Editorial Synthesis
        </h2>
        <p>
          Google Gemini Flash processes the source documents using a strict editorial prompt:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 mt-2 text-slate-300">
          <li>Extract verifiable metrics, benchmark figures, and architectural details.</li>
          <li>Format three concise "Executive Takeaways".</li>
          <li>Maintain neutral, rigorous engineering tone.</li>
          <li>Always preserve primary citation links.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-sm font-bold">4</span>
          Zero-Cost Serverless Deployment
        </h2>
        <p>
          Every article is committed as a structured Markdown file with typed frontmatter into the GitHub repository. GitHub Actions automatically executes the Astro static site generator and updates the GitHub Pages deployment. Zero servers, zero database costs, maximum speed.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
